# Ireena Kolyana (and Ismark) in Vallaki, when the party leaves her at the Blue Water Inn or at St. Andral's
# (docs/voice/ireena.md, docs/voice/ismark.md). While she travels as a guest she speaks inside other conversations.

~ at_inn
if flag.bones_returned
Ireena: Father Lucian sent word. His saint is home and his church is holy ground again. He says there's a bed in the vestry with my name on it.
else
Ireena: The Martikovs are kind. Urwin sits up all night watching the windows. I've never met a man so interested in birds.
endif
-> inn_menu

~ inn_menu
* [if flag.bones_returned] Then go to St. Andral's. You'll be safest there. -> to_church
* Come with us again. -> rejoin
* [if flag.ireena_met and flag.izek_story_heard and flag.izek_dolls_seen and not flag.izek_sister_truth] Ireena, what do you remember from before Kolyan found you? -> remember
* [if flag.izek_sister_truth and not flag.izek_told_truth] Ireena, it's about Izek. -> tell_her
* Rest well. -> END

~ at_church
if flag.vallaki_backed == "baron" and not flag.izek_dead and not flag.izek_told_truth
Ireena [afraid]: Izek comes to the church door at dusk. He doesn't come in. He can't, or he won't. He just stands there.
elif flag.vallaki_backed == "neither"
Ireena [smile]: Father Lucian's teaching me the long prayers. I'm terrible at them. He says the saint doesn't mind. I slept through the night again.
else
Ireena: I slept through the night. The whole night. I'd forgotten that was a thing people did.
endif
-> church_menu

~ church_menu
* Come with us again. -> rejoin
* [if flag.ireena_met and flag.izek_story_heard and flag.izek_dolls_seen and not flag.izek_sister_truth] Ireena, what do you remember from before Kolyan found you? -> remember
* [if flag.izek_sister_truth and not flag.izek_told_truth] Ireena, it's about Izek. -> tell_her
* Rest well. -> END

~ to_church
set ireena_sanctuary = "st_andrals"
quest sanctuary_for_ireena sanctuary
Ireena: Holy ground. Father would have liked that. I'll go tonight, before the light goes.
if flag.ismark_guards_ireena
Ismark: And I'll go and sit by a different door. I'm getting very good at doors.
endif
-> END

~ rejoin
join ireena
set ireena_sanctuary = "with_party"
quest sanctuary_for_ireena travels_on
Ireena: Good. I was going mad sitting still. Walls didn't keep him out of my father's house; I'd rather take my chances with you.
if flag.ismark_guards_ireena
join ismark
set ismark_guards_ireena = false
Ismark: Where she goes, I go. Don't make me say anything sentimental about it.
endif
-> END

~ remember
Ireena: Before Kolyan? Nothing. Trees. Being cold. A boy shouting a name through the trees, over and over. I always thought the name must have been mine.
Narrator: A boy in the woods by the lake. Wolves. A little sister who was never found, and an arm that was never found either. Izek's story fits Ireena's like a key in a lock.
set izek_sister_truth
quest izek_obsession truth_guessed
Ireena [afraid]: Why are you all looking at me like that?
-> tell_her

~ tell_her
Narrator: You tell her what you think: that the man who carves her face into dolls is the boy who lost his sister in the woods.
Ireena [afraid]: Izek? That brute with the arm? He's my brother?
Ireena: I don't remember him. I don't remember anything. And he's dreamed of me every night since he was nine.
Ireena [sad]: I'd rather he knew. If he's going to look at me like that, I'd rather he knew why. Tell him, if you can make him listen.
-> END

~ ismark_at_inn
Ismark: I'm guarding. This is what guarding looks like. It involves a great deal of wine and a lot of looking at doors.
* Come with us again, Ismark. -> ismark_rejoin
* Keep guarding. -> END

~ ismark_at_church
Ismark: Holy ground. I keep feeling I should take my boots off. Lucian says I needn't. I've taken them off anyway.
* Come with us again, Ismark. -> ismark_rejoin
* Keep guarding. -> END

~ ismark_rejoin
join ismark
set ismark_guards_ireena = false
Ismark: About time. She's safe here, and I'm going soft. Lead on.
-> END
